  "findings": [
    "Publisher OptiFine I7 pre1 loads publisher BSL 10.1.2, and active scenes visibly show BSL rendering.",
    "Both entity toggle sequences visibly traverse OptiFine Options, Video Settings, and Shaders screens, select OFF, then reselect the exact BSL_v10.1.2.zip entry.",
    "Ghost and Wraith shaders-off captures show vanilla rendering; restored captures return to BSL rendering, matching live active/false/active state records.",
    "Ghost and Wraith remain visible across day, night, native rain, dark/bright backgrounds, and indoor scenes; movement and red damage tint are visible.",
    "Invisibility, spectator translucency, native outlines, seven block surfaces and lit states, worn armor and glint, inventory previews, projectiles, and the populated Spectral Infuser GUI are distinct and legible."
  ],
